  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| netlify-cli | devDependencies | patch | `1.2.2` -> `1.2.3` | [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>netlify/cli</summary>\n\n### [`v1.2.3`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#v200-alpha1httpsgithubcomnetlifyclicomparev123v200-alpha1---2018-08-16)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/compare/76d798c170f5962353fe25bf22a4221b0a9a83ab...v1.2.3)\n\n##### Merged\n\n-   update open cmd [`#81`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/81)\n-   Fix function uploads [`#70`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/70)\n-   Update status command [`#69`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/69)\n-   Remove help plugin [`#68`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/68)\n-   Function deploys [`#62`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/62)\n-   Add unlink command [`#67`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/67)\n-   Fix api calls [`#65`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/65)\n-   Add inquirer prompts [`#45`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/45)\n-   Swap deps [`#46`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/46)\n-   Use open-api spec directly [`#44`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/44)\n-   Deploy Command [`#37`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/37)\n-   Add status command [`#38`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/38)\n-   Add whoami command [`#36`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/36)\n-   Init again [`#31`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/31)\n-   Site config [`#27`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/pull/27)\n\n##### Commits\n\n-   Reset Repo [`b62819b`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/commit/b62819bc9e1c05c01ea8c284ce6e1c2586226aea)\n-   Use r2 API client using open-api derived methods [`080572f`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/commit/080572fdad2e7decd415c1002d3bb55f153bc198)\n-   Check in function deploy work [`48b7605`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/netlify/cli/commit/48b76055061eecb6ee7ed9d2057e0580d3028095)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
